      "message": "I\u0027m fine with differences between soong and make, but we\u0027d need to make the androidmk tool capable of doing the conversion.\n\nbuild_target is way too generic for a property name, I\u0027d expect that to be a product name or architecture, not an sdk selector.\n\nBlueprint syntax is relatively simple by design, and we try to keep complicated parsing out of string types.  We could support:\nbuild_target {\n    // One of:\n    sdk: 23,\n    current: true,\n    system_current: true,\n    platform: true,\n}\n\nbut this affects both java and native code (which uses sdk_version to select NDK apis), so it would be a big modification of all the Android.bp files.",
